@startuml
' Closing a meter: nothing is deleted until the meter account is gone.
' Source for public/assets/img/two-orderings-close-*.png.
!include style.iuml
$lifelines()

B -> S : POST the close,\nsigned with the browser's key
S -> C : send the close\n(the server adds its signature)
S -> C : ask about the close,\nup to 6 times, 2 s apart

alt refused, or landed and failed
  S --> B : nothing was deleted
else confirmed, or no answer after 6 asks
  S -> C : read the meter account
  alt account gone
    S -> D : delete sessions, grants, lock row
    S --> B : the meter is closed
  else account still there
    S -> D : note: a close is pending
    S --> B : forgotten once the close lands
  end
end

note over S, C
  The status only says when to look.
  The missing account is the proof.
end note
@enduml
